## Routes principales de l’API

### Authentification

```http
POST /api/auth/register
POST /api/auth/login
GET  /api/auth/profile
GET  /api/auth/owner-only
GET  /api/auth/admin-only
```

Exemple register :

```json
{
  "firstName": "Olive",
  "lastName": "Biloa",
  "email": "olive@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "locataire"
}
```

Exemple login :

```json
{
  "email": "olive@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}
```

Rôles possibles selon le projet :

```text
locataire
proprietaire
admin
```

